# DDEV (contrib add-on)

This project runs inside **DDEV** with the ddev-drupal-contrib add-on.
Treat the web container as the source of truth for PHP, Composer, and Drupal.

## Commands

Always use the DDEV wrappers. Never use `ddev exec vendor/bin/…`,
`./vendor/bin/…`, or any bare host binary invocation.

```bash
ddev phpunit …
ddev phpcs …
ddev phpstan …
ddev phpcbf …
```

## Agent behavior

- **NEVER** use bare host invocations like `./vendor/bin/phpunit`.
- **NEVER attempt to regenerate `coverage.xml`** or run PHPUnit with
  `--coverage-*` flags unless the user explicitly asks for it.
- Do not loop retrying failed commands. If a command fails, stop and
  report the error to the user.
